Z||000017||SCCA FIERO||05-02-2000||11:39 PM||||I'm a lucky 88 owner with the new design motors... they're so quiet. <P>Heres a neat trick: with your lights on, turn them off and when they get half way down turn your parking lights on. This won't fix busted motors or nuttin like that, but the lights stop going down and are half way closed, with the lights off. I need a life.||||reg||1
